{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_02DA60","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"这次又是Selva de la Muerte，“死亡之森”吗。确实，要是在这种地方迷路，恐怕没法活着回来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":"JPN_SURVIVAL_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"是啊。不过放心，我会好好给你带路的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"那就拜托了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":"JPN_DIRECT_REQUEST_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"对了，Snake，你知道“树懒”吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":44,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"只知道名字。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"树懒很厉害哦。除了排泄以外，几乎都待在树上。而且几乎不吃东西。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"不吃？那它们怎么活下去？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":"AUX_ROW_MISALIGNMENT_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"因为叫“树懒”嘛。它们几乎不动，所以消耗的能量很少。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":"AUX_FIRST_CLAUSE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"而且还能把体温维持在较低水平。这样代谢会进一步降低，只靠很少的食物也能生活。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":"AUX_SURVIVE_ON_LITTLE_FOOD_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"但那样不是很快就会被吃掉吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":"AUX_PREDATOR_WORDING_NOT_EXPLICIT_IN_JPN"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"听说它们紧贴着树木进行伪装，所以很难被发现。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":"JPN_CAMOUFLAGE_PRIMARY"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"听说有些树懒上了年纪，体表还会长出苔藓。简直就是森林里的仙人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":"AUX_FOREST_HERMIT_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"原来如此……动物和狙击手在森林里的生存策略都一样吗。难怪那个老头那么强。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":"AUX_EXPLICIT_OLD_SNIPER_ADDITION_REMOVED_PER_JPN"},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"老头？你说的是谁……？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":33,"review_flag":"AUX_OLD_SNIPER_ADDITION_REMOVED"}]}